---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Say hello
permalink: /contact/
---
<p class="contact-intro">If something here helped, or you think I got it wrong, I'd like to know. The same goes for speaking invitations, or a knotty problem at work you want to talk through. I read every message myself, so you'll get a real reply, usually within a few days.</p>

<form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" action="/contact/thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
  <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">

  <p class="visually-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <label>Leave this field empty <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
  </p>

  <div class="contact-field">
    <label for="contact-name">Name</label>
    <input type="text" id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-field">
    <label for="contact-email">Email</label>
    <input type="email" id="contact-email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-field">
    <label for="contact-message">Message</label>
    <textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="8" required></textarea>
  </div>

  <p class="contact-privacy">I'll only use your details to reply to you.</p>

  <button type="submit" class="contact-submit">Send</button>
</form>
